  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">ISK avrop Peace Parks Foundation Sweden 2025</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Internal control review of Peace Parks Foundation Sweden 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The assignment aims at assessing the internal control of Peace Parks Foundation. We will review which routines and systems for operational and financial control with special focus on the areas mentioned above. Through the assignment we will identify eventual weaknesses and provide recommendations for improvement. The recommendations will be structured according to priority.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Uppdraget syftar till att bed&#xf6;ma den interna kontrollen inom Peace Parks Foundation. Vi kommer att granska vilka rutiner och system f&#xf6;r operativ och finansiell kontroll &#xe4;r med s&#xe4;rskilt fokus p&#xe5; de omr&#xe5;den som n&#xe4;mns ovan. Genom uppdraget kommer vi att identifiera eventuella svagheter och ge rekommendationer till f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttringar. Rekommendationerna kommer att struktureras efter prioritet.</narrative>
  </description>
